  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "原來台語聲調是有規則--ê！   "
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>鄭雁馨</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">過去四個外月學習台文讀寫ê過程，ē-sái講是真特殊ê經驗mā真心適。雖然逐禮拜lóng ài khai一兩點鐘寫宿題，iáu-m̄-koh我學著tsiok濟。Tse應該就是人講ê「有工就有夫」！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">上課頭起先ê「特殊」感覺是：踮tī頭殼內面幾若十冬ê語詞， 我總算第一擺看著in用羅馬字kap漢字寫-出-來ê樣貌。另外，mā有學變調規則，tsiah知影原來台語ê音調變化是有規則--ê！Íng-tsūn我lóng掠準台語ê音就是ē變來變去，tuè人講tsiah ē-hiáu，並無一个規律。Tsit種先ē-hiáu聽講tsiah濟年tsiah ē-hiáu讀寫ê狀況，實在是tsiânn ku怪--ê！其實真悲哀ê原因是因為國家語言政策所致使。M̄知影ài到啥mih時tsūn，lán台灣ê囡仔tsiah ē-sái tī學校學著台文全套ê聽講讀寫--leh？</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">第二个感想是：學各種發音kap聲調ê hit幾禮拜，幫助lán建立對各種音ê敏感度ê練習無啥有夠。一下仔就開始練寫造句，我感覺拼音ê基礎練了無夠。若是逐禮拜lóng有tsiânn濟有關無仝款ê母音、子音、鼻母音kap韻母韻尾ê重複練習題，應該基礎ē khah tīng-tauh！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">最後, 也是真感謝我ê同事介民sia̋n-pái kā我紹介豐惠老師，tsiah hōo我有tsit个機會來學台文讀寫，mā真感謝老師過去四個外月ê指導hām牽教，我tsiah ē-sái開始沓沓仔kā íng-tsūn bē-hiáu ê台語文學hōo好！希望未來有一工我ē-tàng用tsiok liàn-tńg ê台文寫文章、分享我ê學術研究。&nbsp;</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-small;\">（作者是第16期「Ē-liàn-tńg台語讀寫基礎班」結業學員，中研院社會所研究員。）</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span></span><span><!--more--></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjKl4uwf__2I6y-f-Jw8PnlR4g76UU-lxLe4zSO1fmji3LcK4aT8IYtQvkZg8XeuCwOLPURuAzv4iudkXUkiz7LRG_iP247Wa8nZa99z260MizTPCnnfCqr2KfPco5sFoOxmW2kcKfflp56-I6GRGuljA59WOpds1fDrF88rfiVMPrJUVdus-6RUl8C1HUn/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1354%E6%9C%9F_015.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjKl4uwf__2I6y-f-Jw8PnlR4g76UU-lxLe4zSO1fmji3LcK4aT8IYtQvkZg8XeuCwOLPURuAzv4iudkXUkiz7LRG_iP247Wa8nZa99z260MizTPCnnfCqr2KfPco5sFoOxmW2kcKfflp56-I6GRGuljA59WOpds1fDrF88rfiVMPrJUVdus-6RUl8C1HUn/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1354%E6%9C%9F_015.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjkBNhYH5yQNtnFWOqTu7UKdBfeD6P3Ku5fSn1uuCskLFe9M4Fiz1IvyZhFyxUVyv5XjqMPePruWPNPtg6UfiatLhX3-_DFG5rSx4AFXZmFbtwFfeXpAAr9FBYY6GPTVZQXaQ-6qlsgQ7XirtrAKVEKEBOY16IVyYDhCMsFS9QhyphenhyphenJ-yEUui6lbW2utSHBZ_/s1424/354%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjkBNhYH5yQNtnFWOqTu7UKdBfeD6P3Ku5fSn1uuCskLFe9M4Fiz1IvyZhFyxUVyv5XjqMPePruWPNPtg6UfiatLhX3-_DFG5rSx4AFXZmFbtwFfeXpAAr9FBYY6GPTVZQXaQ-6qlsgQ7XirtrAKVEKEBOY16IVyYDhCMsFS9QhyphenhyphenJ-yEUui6lbW2utSHBZ_/w450-h640/354%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div